#: ../../src/pyvista_wasm/examples.py:docstring of pyvista_wasm.examples.download_sun_surface:3
msgid "Returns the Sun surface image from the PyVista ``solar_textures`` dataset as a :class:`~pyvista_wasm.texture.Texture`, mirroring the ``pyvista.examples.planets.download_sun_surface(texture=True)`` API. Textures are sourced from `Solar Textures <https://www.solarsystemscope.com/textures/>`_."
msgstr ""

